{"description":"Equipo de Intecap Jalapa","image":null,"summary":"We created a presentation about the various spacecraft used by NASA since the 1960s to gather information from space—spacecraft that have since been retired. They fulfilled their missions and made significant contributions to humanity by collecting rocks and geological samples from the Moon, as well as from asteroids and dwarf planets; furthermore, some were used to observe stars and planets located outside our solar system.","details":"<p>It helps inform people about the various spacecraft that have been used since the beginning of space exploration. It provides details on the missions, the samples collected, and the equipment employed.</p>","dataRefs":[["Apollo 11","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1969-059C"],["Apollo 12","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1969-099C"],["Mars Pathfinder","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-pathfinder/"],["Viking 1","https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/missions/viking-1/"],["Apollo 15","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1971-063C"],["Near Shoemaker","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/near-shoemaker/"],["Phoenix","https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/images/pia10760-how-phoenix-looks-under-itself/"],["Dawn","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/dawn/toolkit/quick-facts/"],["Dawn 2","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/dawn/"],["Kepler","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/kepler/"],["Ingenuity","https://scitechdaily.com/nasas-ingenuity-mars-helicopter-goes-on-vacation/"]],"projectRefs":[["Viking 2","https://discovertodayinhistory.com/viking-2-lands-mars-sep-3-1976/#google_vignette"],["Spirit","https://scitechdaily.com/jpl-and-the-space-age-mission-to-mars-rising-again-to-the-red-planet-nasa-documentary/"],["Insight","https://space.skyrocket.de/doc_sdat/insight.htm"]],"members":[{"name":"César Roberto León Morales","country":"Guatemala","avatar":null,"owner":true},{"name":"Jonathan Sarbelio Carias López","country":"Gua